4457
01:38:24,080 --> 01:38:25,080
de

4458
01:38:25,080 --> 01:38:26,080
de jobb,

4459
01:38:26,080 --> 01:38:27,080
mintha nem értenéz.

4460
01:38:27,080 --> 01:38:28,080
De érteni,

4461
01:38:28,080 --> 01:38:29,080
